User Client [icon: monitor] {
  React SPA [icon: react]
  PDF Exporter [icon: file-text]
  Settings Dashboard [icon: settings]
}

API Gateway [icon: server] {
  Express Router [icon: node-js]
  Middleware [icon: shield]
}

Core Backend Services [icon: cpu] {
  Job Manager [icon: list]
  Notebook Assembler [icon: book-open]
  Timestamp Chunker [icon: scissors]
  
  Queue Worker [icon: layers] {
    Adaptive Backoff [icon: clock]
    7s Delay Throttler [icon: pause-circle]
  }
}

Database Layer [icon: database] {
  Prisma ORM [icon: terminal]
  SQLite [icon: database] {
    Jobs Table [icon: table]
    Notebooks Table [icon: table]
    API Keys Pool [icon: key]
  }
}

LLM Routing Layer [icon: git-merge] {
  Multi-LLM Service [icon: activity]
  API Key Rotator [icon: refresh-cw]
  JSON Compiler [icon: file-json]
}

External AI Services [icon: cloud] {
  Gemini 2.5 Flash [icon: google]
  Ollama Local [icon: server]
}

React SPA > Express Router: Submit Request
Express Router > Middleware: Validate
Middleware > Job Manager: Initialize Job

Job Manager > Prisma ORM: Create Job (Pending)
Job Manager > Queue Worker: Add Job

Queue Worker > Job Manager: Process Video
Job Manager > Timestamp Chunker: Slicing Chapters
Timestamp Chunker > Multi-LLM Service: Send Transcript Chunk

Multi-LLM Service > API Key Rotator: Get Active Key
API Key Rotator > JSON Compiler: Inject Key
JSON Compiler > Gemini 2.5 Flash: Single-Shot Prompt

Gemini 2.5 Flash > Adaptive Backoff: 429 Error
Adaptive Backoff > API Key Rotator: Mark Key Exhausted

Gemini 2.5 Flash > Notebook Assembler: JSON Response
Notebook Assembler > Prisma ORM: Update Progress
Prisma ORM > SQLite: Write State
Job Manager > React SPA: SSE Events
